Add ``icalendar.recurrence.iter_instances``, a read-only, lazy iterator that expands the recurrence set (``RRULE``, ``RDATE``, ``EXDATE``, and ``RECURRENCE-ID`` exceptions) of the events in a calendar within a caller-specified time window and timezone. Each instance reports its original identity, actual start, and source, with diagnostics for invalid rules and nonexistent or ambiguous local times.
